WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.302
-We are hanging out with 14-time

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.771
Major League
all-star Alex Rodriguez!

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.805
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.607
[ Laughing ]

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.476
Oh, how cool, man.

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:12.245
Alex and I
are about to go head-to-head

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:13.846
in a game
of Egg Russian Roulette.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.015
Higgins, do you want to explain
how this works?

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.517
-Of course, James!

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.918
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.855
Here in my hand
I have one dozen eggs.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.657
Eight...
-Aw, man.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.059
-...of them
have been hard-boiled.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.595
Four of them are still raw.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.830
You and Alex will take turns

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.366
smashing an egg
upon the top of your head.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.434
[ Laughing ]

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.302
You won't know
which eggs are raw

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.504
and which are the hard-boiled...
[ Laughs ]

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:40.073
...until you smash them!

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.841
And once you choose an egg,

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:43.776
you must smash that egg
upon your head.

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:44.777
No put-backs.

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:45.945
-Okay, of course.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.981
-First one to smash
two r-r-r-raw eggs --

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:49.082
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.482
-Jimmy, the helmet
might be a bit much.

00:00:50.482 --> 00:00:51.784
-Oh, yeah.
The helmet's a bit much.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:53.152
I think it --
-I think I'm a bit much.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.653
-Yeah, exactly. Yeah.

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:58.224
-Alex, as a guest of our show,
you shall choose the first egg.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.492
-I'm gonna get me
some batting gloves on.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.994
-Oh, snap.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.461
-Oh, my God!

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:03.562
That is the coolest.

00:01:03.562 --> 00:01:05.164
This is fantastic
to see this happen.

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.800
-All right. Am I first?
-Yes.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.734
-Oh, my gosh.
This is unbelievable.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.102
I love that you're doing this.
-Choose wisely.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.237
-Like Michael Jackson.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.538
-That's the one,
Michael Jackson right there.

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:15.341
Go for it, man.
-Here we go.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.009
-Good l-u-u-u-uck!

00:01:17.009 --> 00:01:18.211
-What does it feel?
What does it feel?

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:19.211
What does it feel?

00:01:19.211 --> 00:01:21.180
-It feels lucky.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.282
Here we go.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:23.482
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:24.684
I hope my girls
are not watching.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.186
They're sleeping.

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:28.421
-Yeah! You did it!

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.156
That's good, that's good.
That's it -- hard-boiled.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.625
-Whew! Whew.
Good.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:33.860
-You got away with that one.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.561
-Good, good, good, good, good.
Whew!

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.596
-James.

00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:38.865
-I'm just gonna go right for it.
Here we go.

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:39.899
-Go for it!

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.200
-Yeah. How does it feel?
How does it feel?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.368
-Feels great, man.
Good to see you.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.437
Thank you so much
for coming on the show, man!

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.437
You're the best!

00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:46.505
-Aah!
[ Laughing ]

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:50.910
[ Audience groans, applause ]

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.311
-That is ridiculous.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:54.613
That sounded
like it was hard-boiled.

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.283
That sounded
liked it was hard-boiled!

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.952
Oh, God.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.386
That sounded
like it was hard-boiled, man.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:01.454
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.189
-Aw, man.
You can't tell the difference.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.724
-All right, here we go.
Here we go.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:06.125
-I'm so mad.

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:07.827
That was the first one
out of the box.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.028
-All right, here we go.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.429
I'm gonna do it just like you --
nice and quick,

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:11.664
not thinking about it too much.

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.065
Boo--
Ohh!

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:16.102
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:21.374
-Did you see it?
Slow-motion.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:22.975
-Oh!
-Look at slow-motion.

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:25.311
-Ohh!
-Oh, my God.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.379
Dude, this is --
[ Laughing ]

00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:28.448
That was the best way.

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:29.716
I didn't think
anyone would do that.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:30.816
Oh, my God.

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:32.785
It didn't feel
like it was raw, right?

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.054
-That was a home run.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.222
-All right, I'm gonna go
with this one?

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.490
No, this one.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.657
-Oh-ho-ho!
-This one.

00:02:38.657 --> 00:02:40.326
-Oh, yeah.
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:41.694
-Oh, baby.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.663
-[ Breathes deeply ]

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.364
Thank you so much
for coming on the show, man.

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.700
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.368
-Good luck
with the All-Star game.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:52.938
July 11th, on Fox.

00:02:52.938 --> 00:02:53.973
-Oh!
-No.

00:02:53.973 --> 00:02:55.107
No, no! No, you're good.

00:02:55.107 --> 00:02:56.309
You're good, you're good,
you're good.

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Applause ]

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.279
All right.
-I'm still in it.

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:01.747
-All right.

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:03.282
-It's a barn burner.

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:05.117
-Jimmy, I just want
to say you're a great host.

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:07.086
Thanks for inviting me
and making a fool out of me.

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:09.222
Here we go --
1, 2, 3 -- ohh!

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.723
-Aha-ha-ha!

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:12.792
[ Audience groans, applause ]

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.793
-I got the win!
I won!

00:03:14.793 --> 00:03:16.629
I won.
I love this.

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:17.763
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:20.132
You're the best, man.
-Oh, I love it.

00:03:20.132 --> 00:03:22.335
Yeah!
-Alex Rodriguez, everybody!

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.036
Nick Kroll
joins us after the break.

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:25.371
Stick around, everybody!

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:26.572
I'm the champ!

00:03:26.572 --> 00:03:27.907
Oh, my gosh!

